<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="30c766cf">&lt;h4&gt;
    When to apply this capability
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Utilize this practice when performing hardware and software testing on the target solution.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;
    Getting started
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Start discussions with teams responsible for designing, preparing and conducting IT software based tests. Review the
    work products and the sequence of tasks defined in this practice with appropriate&amp;nbsp;test resources and leverage the
    core material where applicable.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;
    Common pitfalls
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Especially for large projects,&amp;nbsp;a well-defined test strategy and approach is essential for successful testing of
    the target solution. Defining the what the test effort entails and how the test objectives are achieved acts as the
    foundation for designing, preparing and conducting IT based test.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
